<mxfile host="thecodeclouds.com" agent="hand-built" version="24.0.0" type="device">
<diagram id="training-pipeline" name="2. Training pipeline"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="800" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="SageMaker Pipelines: the weekly fraud-model retrain, from point-in-time features to a registered candidate" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1400" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;What starts a run&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#E7157B;fillColor=#FDF2F8;dashed=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#E7157B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="220" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="sched" value='&lt;b&gt;EventBridge Scheduler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#545B64"&gt;Sunday 02:00 UTC&lt;/font&gt;' style="sketch=0;points=[];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.eventbridge_scheduler;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="100" width="44" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="gitm" value='&lt;b&gt;Merge to main&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#545B64"&gt;pipeline code changed&lt;/font&gt;' style="sketch=0;points=[];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.git_repository;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="225" width="44" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="drift" value='&lt;b&gt;Drift alarm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#545B64"&gt;(on-call confirms first)&lt;/font&gt;' style="sketch=0;points=[];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.alarm;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="350" width="44" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pl" value="&lt;b&gt;SageMaker Pipelines, ml-tooling account, private VPC subnets, network isolation on training&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#01A88D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="60" width="1210" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c4" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.11;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sched" target="pl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c5" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.33;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gitm" target="pl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c6" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.555;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="drift" target="pl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s1" value="1  BuildDataset (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Point-in-time join from the offline&lt;br&gt;store: 18 months, 41 M transactions.&lt;br&gt;Label = chargeback or confirmed&lt;br&gt;fraud within 90 days." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s2" value="2  ValidateData (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Schema, nulls, ranges, fraud rate&lt;br&gt;(0.1-0.3%), drift vs last training&lt;br&gt;set. Stops the run on failure." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="3  Train (Training job)&lt;br&gt;XGBoost, managed Spot +&lt;br&gt;checkpoints. Out-of-time split:&lt;br&gt;train to M-3, validate M-2,&lt;br&gt;test on M-1." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s4" value="4  Evaluate (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Candidate and champion scored&lt;br&gt;on the same test month: recall&lt;br&gt;at 0.5% alert rate, PR-AUC,&lt;br&gt;per-segment results." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c11" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c12" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c13" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cond" value="5  Better than&lt;br&gt;the champion?" style="rhombus;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="250" width="210" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c15" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" target="cond"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1345" y="158"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c16" value="Rules: recall at budget +1 pt or more,&lt;br&gt;no segment worse by over 2 pts,&lt;br&gt;model size under 200 MB." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#545B64;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="230" width="210" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="fail" value="Fail step&lt;br&gt;reason logged to MLflow,&lt;br&gt;Slack note, champion stays" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#DD344C;fillColor=#FDF1F2;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="400" width="210" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c18" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#DD344C;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;startArrow=none;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=4;startSize=4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cond" target="fail"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c19" value="no" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="372" width="30" height="17" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s6" value="6  Explain + fairness (Processing)&lt;br&gt;SHAP global importance, top-20&lt;br&gt;features. Decline-rate parity by&lt;br&gt;card type and country, computed&lt;br&gt;with pandas and scikit-learn." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="470" width="230" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s7" value="7  Baselines (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Feature histograms and score&lt;br&gt;distribution of the test month,&lt;br&gt;written to S3 for the drift job." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="470" width="220" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s8" value="8  RegisterModel (ModelStep)&lt;br&gt;Version in fraud-scorer group,&lt;br&gt;status PendingManualApproval,&lt;br&gt;metrics, commit SHA, dataset&lt;br&gt;URI, baseline URIs attached." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="470" width="220" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
